@730. "The woman drunk with the blood of the saints"... (Revelation 17:6) = that religiosity insane from the adulterated and profaned Divine truths and goods of the Lord, of the Word, and thence of the Church... "The saints" = those who from the Lord through the Word are in Divine truths; and, abstractedly, the Divine truths of the Lord, of the Word, and thence of the Church. @801. @AE 1049. @1193.

@752. (Sixtus V.) said that their saints are not anything.

