@AC 124. The Lord compares Himself to a "householder"...

@1795. The External Church is called "the steward of the house" when the Internal Church is called the "house," and the Lord the householder.

@3020. All things in man are circumstanced like one house, that is, like one family; in that there is one who fills the office of householder, and those who fill the office of servants. The rational mind itself is that which disposes all things as the householder...

