@1616[5]. Thus He became, at the same time, as to His Human Essence, innocence itself and love itself...

@1635[end]. Human discourse falls in through the ear...

@1675. "Esau" or "Edom" = the Lord as to His Human Essence...

@--[2]. By Chedorlaomer is represented... the Lord's Human Essence as to good and truth in His childhood...

