@--[5]. His Human Essence is called "the Star which will arise out of Jacob..."

@--[6]. The Lord's Human Essence is celestial love itself.

@1707[5]. His interior man as to... truths was adjoined to the external man, and thus was Human; but this also... was made Divine...

